  "steps": [
    "Splash some oil in a pan and add low fat paneer cubes in medium flame.",
    "Toss it well until it starts to changes its colour.",
    "Now transfer into a bowl and in same pan splash some oil.",
    "Keep flame medium and add jeera, fennel seeds, green chilli, onion. Curry leaves, Ginger garlic paste.",
    "Sauce until onion starts to change its colour.",
    "Now add the masala and salt and water.",
    "Mix it all well for 2 mins.",
    "Now add paneer cubes and mix it all well in high flame for 2 mins.",
    "Check the salt and switch off the flame.",
    "Now add black pepper powder, Lemon juice and coriander leaves.",
    "Enjoy it!!!"
